						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
					</a>
					<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium mb-3">
						Change the color of your diagram symbols instantly without editing materials or opening nested components manually.
					</p>
					<ul class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-2 mb-5 list-disc list-inside">
						<li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Select the symbol in your SketchUp viewport.</li>
						<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Click the <strong>Color Button</strong> in the Dynamic Symbols palette.</li>
						<li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Choose your color from the picker — done!</li>
						<li><em>Tip:</em> The plugin automatically remembers your last 5 colors for fast access.</li>
					</ul>
					<div>
						<a href="https://youtu.be/VOl67HeTK8M?si=Hoxn73WtmgsATYsa&t=72" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 text-slate-950 font-bold transition-all shadow-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
							▶️ See How It Works
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 3 -->
			<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-lg flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-center transition-all hover:border-amber-500/30">
				<div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center">
					<div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-0 shadow-none flex items-center justify-center">
