						<li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Select the Dynamic Symbols you want to animate.</li>
						<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Click <strong>Create Animation</strong>. The plugin automatically creates 3 animation scenes: <code>Feb_F1</code>, <code>Feb_F2</code>, <code>Feb_F3</code>.</li>
						<li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Go to <strong>File → Export → Animation</strong> in SketchUp to render your high-quality video clip.</li>
